    },
    {
      "source_id": "lm75a",
      "page": 9,
      "snippet": "Configuration register table (Table 5) shows the bit assignments"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "lm75a",
      "page": 9,
      "snippet": "If the Temp data MSB bit D10 = 0 then the temperature is positive and Temp value (°C) = +(Temp data) * 0.125 °C"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "lm75a",
      "page": 10,
      "snippet": "only 9 bits of the two bytes are used to store the set-point data in 2's complement format with the resolution of 0.5 °C"
    },
    {
